## Licensing overview

- **This repository (clone / GitHub default):** the **MIT License** text below applies to the source tree unless you choose GPL terms from the add-on package.
- **Blender Extensions** (extensions.blender.org) and the **release zip** built by `build_vfb_zip.py`: the add-on folder declares **GPL-3.0-or-later** in `blender_manifest.toml`, with full GPL text in `VFB_instance_manager/GPL-3.0.txt` and a short notice in `VFB_instance_manager/LICENSE`.

Viclant (copyright holder) uses this **dual licensing** so GitHub can stay MIT while GPL applies to the add-on zip as declared in `blender_manifest.toml` and `VFB_instance_manager/LICENSE`.

